- Total earnings: $ 64 + 16 = 80 $

Thus, Will made a total of $\boxed{80}$ dollars in those two days. 

The calculations are correct, and there is no mention of additional factors like overtime or discounts, so the total is simply the sum of the earnings from each day. 

