Okay, first thing I need to do is figure out how many members actually showed up for the game. The total number of members is 14, and 7 didn't show up. So, if I subtract the number of people who didn't come from the total, that should give me the number of people who did come. Let me write that down: 14 total members minus 7 who didn't show up equals... let's see, 14 minus 7 is 7. Wait, so 7 members showed up?

